            # word when the source English was plural (e.g. "幹線s", "器具s") --
            # the substring substitution above replaces the singular English root
            # but the English plural "s" suffix has no Japanese equivalent to
            # consume it, so it must be stripped explicitly rather than left
            # attached to non-Latin text.
            _out=re.sub(r"([ぁ-んァ-ヶ一-龯々〆ヵヶ])s\b", r"\1", _out)

